---
description: Enforce inward-only imports between Clean Architecture packages
globs: packages/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Layer imports

```ts
// ❌ BAD — domain must not know about use cases or databases
import { SendMessage } from "@clean-chat/core/use-cases";
import { Postgres } from "@clean-chat/infrastructure";

// ✅ GOOD — schema first, then a plain type
import { Type, type Static } from "@sinclair/typebox";
export const ChannelSchema = Type.Object({ /* ... */ });
export type Channel = Static<typeof ChannelSchema>;
```

- `@clean-chat/core` — TypeBox only. `src/domain/` must not import `src/use-cases/` or `src/events/`
- `@clean-chat/application` — core (interactors and driven ports live here)
- `@clean-chat/infrastructure` — any inner package; implement ports here (`UnitOfWork`, repositories, `EventPublisher` + `EventSubscriber`)
- `@clean-chat/client` — core only; isomorphic driving adapters (`createHttpClient` in `src/http/`)
